{"id":"27512705907dad0b","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-prg-from-owf.md","title":"Equivalence of OWFs and PRGs","display":"thm-prg-from-owf — Equivalence of OWFs and PRGs","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-prg-from-owf","aliases":["28-thm-prg-from-owf","PRGs Exist iff OWFs Exist"],"display":"thm-prg-from-owf — Equivalence of OWFs and PRGs","depends_on":["[[28-df-one-way-function]]","[[28-df-prg]]"],"source_book_location":"Theorem 9.9, Lemma 9.10 and chapter summary; printed pp.180,194; PDF pp.206,220","source_printed_pages":"180,194","source_pdf_pages":"206,220","source_status":"statement-checked","proof_status":"not-audited","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-prg-from-owf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-prg-from-owf</span><span>PRGs Exist iff OWFs Exist</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-prg-from-owf — Equivalence of OWFs and PRGs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76af324ae3acb27e\" href=\"?note=76af324ae3acb27e\" title=\"28-df-one-way-function\">28-df-one-way-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"10640aec74cc5cc9\" href=\"?note=10640aec74cc5cc9\" title=\"28-df-prg\">28-df-prg</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Theorem 9.9, Lemma 9.10 and chapter summary; printed pp.180,194; PDF pp.206,220"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"180,194"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"206,220"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-audited"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{OWF}\">\\(\\mathbf{OWF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76af324ae3acb27e\" href=\"?note=76af324ae3acb27e\" title=\"28-df-one-way-function\">28-df-one-way-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PRG}\">\\(\\mathbf{PRG}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"10640aec74cc5cc9\" href=\"?note=10640aec74cc5cc9\" title=\"28-df-prg\">28-df-prg</a>。二者均使用均匀概率多项式时间攻击者。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\mathbf{OWF}\\ne\\varnothing\\bigr)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\bigl(\\mathbf{PRG}\\ne\\varnothing\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\mathbf{OWF}\\ne\\varnothing\\bigr)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\bigl(\\mathbf{PRG}\\ne\\varnothing\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正向为定理 9.9（HILL）；原书仅证明单向置换的特例 Lemma 9.10，不能把一般情形写成“硬核位加迭代”的现成证明。反向和双向存在性结论在第 9 章总结中明确列出。伸长可由标准迭代增至任意多项式，得到一般 OWF；不声称任意仅增长一位的生成器本身立刻满足强 OWF 定义。本次核对存在性陈述，没有独立审计 HILL 的完整证明。</p>\n<p>R6证据边界：一般HILL构造未在原书证明，尚未独立核验。本条可作为有明确来源限制的陈述记录，当前不作为已完成证明核验的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-one-way-function","status":"resolved","id":"76af324ae3acb27e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-one-way-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-prg","status":"resolved","id":"10640aec74cc5cc9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-prg]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-one-way-function","status":"resolved","id":"76af324ae3acb27e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{OWF}$ 见 [[28-df-one-way-function]]；$\\mathbf{PRG}$ 见 [[28-df-prg]]。二者均使用均匀概率多项式时间攻击者。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-prg","status":"resolved","id":"10640aec74cc5cc9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{OWF}$ 见 [[28-df-one-way-function]]；$\\mathbf{PRG}$ 见 [[28-df-prg]]。二者均使用均匀概率多项式时间攻击者。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{OWF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PRG}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigl(\\mathbf{OWF}\\ne\\varnothing\\bigr)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\bigl(\\mathbf{PRG}\\ne\\varnothing\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1528,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-158","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"构造与证明工具：[[28-thm-goldreich-levin]]、[[28-thm-prg-from-owf]]、[[28-thm-prg-next-bit-characterization]]、[[28-df-hybrid-distribution]]。"}],"outgoing":["76af324ae3acb27e","10640aec74cc5cc9"]}